{"title":"Baby Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 49 times (1.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 4,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1\n        }</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ember-gland\">Ember Gland</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>2,030</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>3,209</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>2,489</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>1,364</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>3,568</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>2,597</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>2,030</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>3,209</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>2,489</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>1,364</td><td>in the wilds around 2091, 463</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>3,568</td><td>in the wilds around 2093, 448</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>2,597</td><td>in the wilds around 2079, 323</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"baby-red-dragon\" data-map-level=\"57\">Show level 57 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1,271 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1,294 recorded drops, 14,865 total, 1–295 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–295</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\" title=\"Dragon Hide - in 1,270 of 1,271 looted corpses, 1,228 recorded drops, 1,228 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\" title=\"Dragonscale Knick - in 1,270 of 1,271 looted corpses, 1,228 recorded drops, 1,228 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\" title=\"Dragon Fang - in 774 of 1,271 looted corpses, 748 recorded drops, 1,527 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1–3</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+28 more\">+28 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=